      "end": 452.12,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 452.68,
      "end": 453.24,
      "en": "I'm tired.",
      "zh": "我很累。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 453.46,
      "end": 455.34,
      "en": "I'm just going to sit down for a little while.",
      "zh": "我只是要坐一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 457.06,
      "end": 459.1,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 459.1,
      "end": 463.36,
      "en": "It will only hurt for a little while.",
      "zh": "只会痛一小会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 463.36,
      "end": 464.36,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 465.18,
      "end": 466.92,
      "en": "Do you want to play tennis for a little while?",
      "zh": "你想打网球吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 468.84,
      "end": 470.56,
      "en": "So it means for a short time.",
      "zh": "所以这意味着很短的时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 470.8,
      "end": 471.44,
      "en": "For a short time.",
      "zh": "短时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 471.8,
      "end": 472.8,
      "en": "And you can change it, right?",
      "zh": "你可以改变它，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 472.8,
      "end": 475.64,
      "en": "You can say, oh, I'm going to play for a little while.",
      "zh": "你可以说，哦，我要玩一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 475.64,
      "end": 477.98,
      "en": "Yeah, or I'm going to sleep for a little while.",
      "zh": "是的，或者我要睡一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 478.88,
      "end": 479.88,
      "en": "For a short time.",
      "zh": "短时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 479.88,
      "end": 480.88,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 480.88,
      "end": 488.32,
      "en": "All right, so if learners use this phrase, I find it sounds really, really great because it's not something that students normally use.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以如果学习者使用这个短语，我觉得它听起来真的非常非常棒，因为它不是学生通常使用的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 488.7,
      "end": 491.14,
      "en": "Yeah, I guess a student wouldn't really use this phrase normally.",
      "zh": "是的，我猜一个学生不会真正使用这个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 491.5,
      "end": 493.78,
      "en": "Yeah, so guys, use it because you'll sound awesome.",
      "zh": "是的，所以伙计们，使用它，因为你会听起来很棒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 494.14,
      "end": 495.64,
      "en": "Yeah, you'll sound really, really fluent.",
      "zh": "是的，你会听起来真的，真的很流利。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 496.33,
      "end": 498.69,
      "en": "Okay, and let's take a look at our last phrase.",
      "zh": "好的，让我们看看我们的最后一句话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 499.55,
      "end": 500.41,
      "en": "Straight towards.",
      "zh": "径直朝……。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 501.4,
      "end": 502.4,
      "en": "Straight towards.",
      "zh": "径直朝……。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 502.4,
      "end": 503.96,
      "en": "Straight towards me.",
      "zh": "直奔我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 503.96,
      "end": 504.17,
      "en": "Straight towards.",
      "zh": "径直朝……。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 505.15,
      "end": 508.49,
      "en": "Okay, so straight means directly.",
      "zh": "好吧，直接意味着直接。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 509.01,
      "end": 509.73,
      "en": "Right, in a line.",
      "zh": "对了，在一条线上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 509.93,
      "end": 511.73,
      "en": "In a line, not going anywhere else, but directly.",
      "zh": "在一条线上，不去其他任何地方，而是直接。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 512.2,
      "end": 514.24,
      "en": "Not moving side to side.",
      "zh": "没有左右移动。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 514.24,
      "end": 515.95,
      "en": "And towards is in that direction.",
      "zh": "并且朝着那个方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 517.36,
      "end": 521.28,
      "en": "So the shark was coming straight towards me, it's coming directly at me.",
      "zh": "所以鲨鱼直接朝我走来，它直接朝我袭来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 522.28,
      "end": 524.52,
      "en": "Moving in a line and not moving side to side.",
      "zh": "在一条线上移动而不是左右移动。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 525.24,
      "end": 528.86,
      "en": "Okay, so can you give me another example of how you would use straight towards?",
      "zh": "好的，你能给我另一个例子说明你将如何直接使用吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 530.0,
      "end": 530.22,
      "en": "Watch out!",
      "zh": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 531.0,
      "end": 532.06,
      "en": "There's a car coming straight towards you.",
      "zh": "有一辆车直奔你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 532.72,
      "end": 534.1,
      "en": "Okay, directly towards you.",
      "zh": "好吧，直接对你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 534.2,
      "end": 538.56,
      "en": "Yeah, or maybe when I get home from work, I go straight towards the fridge.",
      "zh": "是的，或者当我下班回家时，我会直奔冰箱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 539.1,
      "end": 539.28,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 539.54,
      "end": 539.66,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 540.16,
      "end": 540.72,
      "en": "I believe this.",
      "zh": "我相信这一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 542.12,
      "end": 544.12,
      "en": "All right, so straight towards, directly.",
      "zh": "好吧，那么直接，直接。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 544.34,
      "end": 547.32,
      "en": "Okay, so we've looked at a lot of great words, really good phrases.",
      "zh": "好的，所以我们看了很多很棒的单词，非常好的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 548.28,
      "end": 562.28,
      "en": "Let's listen to this dialogue one last time and then we'll come back and Erica is going to tell us a really great story about boat.",
      "zh": "让我们最后一次听这个对话，然后我们会回来，Erica 将告诉我们一个关于船的非常棒的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 562.28,
      "end": 564.12,
      "en": "This is such a beautiful day.",
      "zh": "天气真好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 564.84,
      "end": 566.12,
      "en": "Great day for sailing.",
      "zh": "真是个适合帆船出行的好天气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 566.12,
      "end": 566.96,
      "en": "It sure is.",
      "zh": "的确如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 567.28,
      "end": 568.56,
      "en": "The water looks so nice.",
      "zh": "水看起来真清澈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 569.28,
      "end": 570.48,
      "en": "Anchor the boat for a little while.",
      "zh": "先抛锚停一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 570.84,
      "end": 571.7,
      "en": "I'm going to take a dip.",
      "zh": "我要下去游一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 576.16,
      "end": 577.92,
      "en": "Why are you doggy paddling?",
      "zh": "你怎么在狗刨？"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 578.32,
      "end": 579.3,
      "en": "I taught you how to swim.",
      "zh": "我教你游泳。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 579.74,
      "end": 581.16,
      "en": "Do your breaststroke.",
      "zh": "做你的蛙泳。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 581.58,
      "end": 582.72,
      "en": "I get too tired.",
      "zh": "那样太累了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 583.56,
      "end": 584.96,
      "en": "I'll just backstroke.",
      "zh": "我还是仰泳吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 585.26,
      "end": 585.54,
      "en": "It's easier.",
      "zh": "那更容易。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 587.44,
      "end": 588.8,
      "en": "Try kicking your legs more.",
      "zh": "试着再多踢踢腿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 589.9,
      "end": 590.3,
      "en": "That's good.",
      "zh": "那很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 591.14,
      "end": 591.84,
      "en": "Don't go out too far.",
      "zh": "别游得太远。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 592.46,
      "end": 593.44,
      "en": "It's fine.",
      "zh": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 594.04,
      "end": 594.74,
      "en": "Jump in.",
      "zh": "跳下去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 595.6,
      "end": 598.6,
      "en": "Cathy, get back here.",
      "zh": "凯茜，回到这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 598.66,
      "end": 599.2,
      "en": "I see a shark.",
      "zh": "我看到鲨鱼了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 599.6,
      "end": 600.6,
      "en": "Help me!",
      "zh": "救救我!"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 600.6,
      "end": 601.6,
      "en": "Help!",
      "zh": "救命！"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 601.6,
      "end": 602.6,
      "en": "Bring the boat closer.",
      "zh": "把船开过来！"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 602.6,
      "end": 603.6,
      "en": "The shark is coming straight towards me.",
      "zh": "鲨鱼直冲我游过来了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 603.6,
      "end": 604.6,
      "en": "It's right under you.",
      "zh": "它就在你正下方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 604.6,
      "end": 605.6,
      "en": "Cathy!",
      "zh": "凯茜！"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 613.71,
      "end": 630.53,
      "en": "All right, well, Marco, I was telling you that I used to spend every summer on the lake and my family had a really small house on a small island and my cousins had another small house on another small island.",
      "zh": "好吧，好吧，马可，我告诉你，我过去每年夏天都会在湖上度过，我的家人在一个小岛上有一所非常小的房子，我的表兄弟们在另一个小岛上又有了一座小房子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 631.68,
      "end": 639.39,
      "en": "So our families are really close and we used to go to one house for dinner one night and the other house to dinner the next night.",
      "zh": "所以我们的家人真的很亲近，我们过去常常去一所房子吃晚饭，第二天晚上去另一家吃晚饭。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 640.16,
      "end": 643.85,
      "en": "So everyone was over at my cousin's house except for my grandfather.",
      "zh": "所以除了我的祖父之外，每个人都在我表弟家。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 645.84,
      "end": 653.0,
      "en": "And so he was thinking, okay, it's late, maybe I better go pick up my wife and see what's going on.",
      "zh": "所以他在想，好吧，来晚了，也许我最好去接我的妻子，看看发生了什么事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 653.0,
      "end": 654.19,
      "en": "So he goes into the boat.",
      "zh": "于是他上了船。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 655.16,
      "end": 655.41,
      "en": "It's dark.",
      "zh": "今天很黑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 656.16,
      "end": 657.16,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 657.16,
      "end": 657.57,
      "en": "There's no light on the boat.",
      "zh": "船上没有灯光。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 658.66,
      "end": 667.42,
      "en": "He's driving straight towards the island when suddenly my cousin in his boat drives directly into my grandfather.",
      "zh": "当我的表弟在他的船上直接开车直接驶向我的祖父时，他正直奔岛屿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 668.2,
      "end": 668.68,
      "en": "So they crashed.",
      "zh": "于是他们崩溃了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 669.2,
      "end": 669.36,
      "en": "They crashed.",
      "zh": "他们崩溃了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 670.2,
      "end": 671.16,
      "en": "Two boats crashed in the lake.",
      "zh": "两艘船在湖中坠毁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 671.68,
      "end": 674.8,
      "en": "And then my grandfather's boat flipped over.",
      "zh": "然后我祖父的船翻了个身。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 675.0,
      "end": 677.32,
      "en": "It turned upside down.",
      "zh": "它颠倒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 677.32,
      "end": 678.28,
      "en": "And he fell in the water.",
      "zh": "他掉进了水里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 679.28,
      "end": 679.96,
      "en": "But he was okay, right?",
      "zh": "但他没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 680.28,
      "end": 681.28,
      "en": "Yeah, he was okay.",
      "zh": "是的，他没事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 681.28,
      "end": 682.36,
      "en": "But you know what?",
      "zh": "不过你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 325,
      "start": 682.36,
      "end": 685.08,
      "en": "He was really angry about this.",
      "zh": "他真的很生气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 326,
      "start": 685.08,
      "end": 685.38,
      "en": "And the boat?",
      "zh": "船呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 327,
      "start": 686.08,
      "end": 690.57,
      "en": "The boat stayed in the water and the engine fell down to the bottom.",
      "zh": "船停在水中，发动机掉到了底部。"
    },
    {
      "id": 328,
      "start": 691.56,
      "end": 694.01,
      "en": "So we had to go the next morning to get the boat.",
      "zh": "所以我们不得不第二天早上去坐船。"
    },
    {
      "id": 329,
      "start": 694.12,
      "end": 700.19,
      "en": "And we actually had to hire some scuba divers to go to the bottom of the lake to get the engine.",
      "zh": "实际上，我们不得不聘请一些水肺潜水员去湖底获取发动机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 330,
      "start": 701.08,
      "end": 702.08,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 331,
      "start": 702.08,
      "end": 703.08,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 332,
      "start": 703.08,
      "end": 704.56,
      "en": "I imagine your grandpa was pretty angry.",
      "zh": "我想你爷爷很生气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 333,
      "start": 704.56,
      "end": 705.56,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 334,
      "start": 705.56,
      "end": 706.07,
      "en": "He tells the story.",
      "zh": "他讲故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 335,
      "start": 706.56,
      "end": 707.31,
      "en": "Every year.",
      "zh": "每年。"
    },
    {
      "id": 336,
      "start": 707.56,
      "end": 708.21,
      "en": "Yeah, exactly.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 337,
      "start": 709.37,
      "end": 710.13,
      "en": "But you know what?",
      "zh": "不过你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 338,
      "start": 710.17,
      "end": 715.03,
      "en": "I've got a million of these crazy lake stories because my family.",
      "zh": "因为我的家人，我有一百万个这些疯狂的湖泊故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 339,
      "start": 715.4,
      "end": 715.95,
      "en": "It always happens.",
      "zh": "它总是发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 340,
      "start": 716.4,
      "end": 717.4,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 341,
      "start": 717.89,
      "end": 718.37,
      "en": "All right, guys.",
      "zh": "好了，各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": 342,
      "start": 718.59,
      "end": 722.71,
      "en": "Well, do you have any crazy stories or any stories related to boats or to swimming?",
      "zh": "那么，你有任何与船或游泳有关的疯狂故事或任何故事吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 343,
      "start": 723.08,
      "end": 723.65,
      "en": "Or to shark attacks?",
      "zh": "还是鲨鱼袭击？"
    },
    {
      "id": 344,
      "start": 724.08,
      "end": 724.71,
      "en": "Or shark attacks?",
      "zh": "还是鲨鱼袭击？"
    },
    {
      "id": 345,
      "start": 725.08,
      "end": 726.08,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 346,
      "start": 726.08,
      "end": 728.28,
      "en": "So come to our website, EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "所以来我们的网站 englishpod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 347,
      "start": 728.28,
      "end": 728.75,
      "en": "Leave your stories.",
      "zh": "留下你的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 348,
      "start": 729.28,
      "end": 729.63,
      "en": "Share with us.",
      "zh": "与我们分享。"
    },
    {
      "id": 349,
      "start": 730.28,
      "end": 733.85,
      "en": "And also, if you have any doubts or questions, Erica and I are always there to answer.",
      "zh": "而且，如果您有任何疑问或疑问，Erica 和我总是在那里回答。"
    },
    {
      "id": 350,
      "start": 734.17,
      "end": 735.85,
      "en": "Well, we're out of time for this lesson.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们没有时间上这节课了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 351,
      "start": 736.24,
      "end": 746.08,
      "en": "But until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "但直到下一次，再见。"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": {
